OL,3,APakistan arrests man wanted by US over
OL,4,A$126m postage fraud case
OL,5,
OL,6,FPakistan's cybercrime agency has
OL,7,Farrested a man accused of running a
OL,8,Fcounterfeit operation that caused $126
OL,9,Fmillion (#94m) in losses to the US
OL,10,FPostal service.
OL,12,FFaheem Akram is accused of having sold
OL,13,Ffake stamps via a fraudulent website in
OL,14,Fthe US since 2023.
OL,16,FHe was indicted by a federal grand jury
OL,17,Fin Florida last month for selling more
OL,18,Fthan five million counterfeit shipping
OL,19,Flabels to thousands of US customers
OL,20,Fover the years. Authorities have now
OL,21,Fshut down the website.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
